			"type": "Line",
			"value": " The operand behind a `>` that may close a type-argument region prints bare, and that `>`",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 111
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " never ends a line: where its comparison breaks, the `>` leads the next line and the bare",
